#: 99155d7c20fc464fb8b5481dabdf6ab6
msgid "Some radio receivers output inverted RSSI values (lowest voltage / PWM on best reception), so _HIGH parameters may actually be set to lower values than corresponding _LOW parameters for correct internal scaling to 0 - 100%."
